{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/514747-the-missing-john-s-scion-resources-pantheons","id":514747,"title":"The Missing John's Scion Resources Pantheons?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-14T20:21:48-07:00","id":514747,"title":"The Missing John's Scion Resources Pantheons?","content":"This has probably been asked multiple times before, but, every topic I found in regards to this either A. States the original creator lost the files or B. A user will PM the files to the topic creator, leaving me in the dust <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> So, I'm wondering if anyone has them on hand and could post 'em/send them to me?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6027-kobuddy","name":"Kobuddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6027_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-15T02:05:02-07:00","id":514915,"title":"","content":"JSR didn't lose the files, they ceased making them available because they're designing, marketing and selling their own mythology-based RPG game. There were legal conflicts. However, they've said it's alright if people share them privately between themselves. They did specifically ask me not to host them anywhere for download, though.<br /> <br /> Which ones do you want? I have some, but not all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-15T08:27:46-07:00","id":515219,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Telgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/514747-the-missing-john-s-scion-resources-pantheons?p=514915#post514915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">JSR didn't lose the files, they ceased making them available because they're designing, marketing and selling their own mythology-based RPG game. There were legal conflicts. However, they've said it's alright if people share them privately between themselves. They did specifically ask me not to host them anywhere for download, though.<br /> <br /> Which ones do you want? I have some, but not all.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Any of the ones you have would be fine. I'm running a Scion campaign myself and would like to open up the pantheons a bit. (Though, if you have the K'uh at least, that'd be great. Been looking for that one for a while.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6027-kobuddy","name":"Kobuddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6027_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-16T07:38:49-07:00","id":516183,"title":"","content":"I have the Alihah, Anunna, Apu, Atua, Bogovi, Elohim, Inue, and Kuh, plus a Reliquary file and a mythologies map.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-16T08:48:55-07:00","id":516216,"title":"","content":"All of what Dataweaver states + I have a HUGE file of all the rules and the start she made on the Hittite pantheon as well. It's hard to tell what else I might have, as it all got sorted into the various relevant sub-folders in my Scion folder.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-16T09:29:21-07:00","id":516238,"title":"","content":"The Pantheons have been sent to me, but, thank you! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I suppose if anyone has the Antagonists pdf around somewhere, that'd really be the only other thing I might need for my campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6027-kobuddy","name":"Kobuddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6027_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T10:12:41-07:00","id":541395,"title":"","content":"Hi, I'm planning a campaign for when my current GM is finished, and was wondering if anybody could PM me some of the Pantheons, especially the Elohim because I have vague plans for a Scion of Baal in the early stages.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-06T10:05:19-07:00","id":542724,"title":"","content":"Sorry to Pile Up but i\u00b4m also interested in this, can some one send me if posible Reliquary file and the Antagonists pdf (my players are not big on Mitology so the basic panteons will be enought)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":