n't wait for their game to come out, if they work half as hard on their original stuff as they did on Scion it's going to be really good. Totally worth my Kickstarter contribution.</div> </div> </div> </div>I also loved that website. They did a lot of great work for Scion. It's a shame they took it down. I'm hoping for good things to come out of Heroes Journey as well, but they're over the Kickstarter deadline by almost a year. At this point it's almost vaporware, but I still have my fingers crossed.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1505-charles-red","name":"Charles Red","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-05T10:38:59-07:00","id":579970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charles Red</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/514747-the-missing-john-s-scion-resources-pantheons?p=579318#post579318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also loved that website. They did a lot of great work for Scion. It's a shame they took it down. I'm hoping for good things to come out of Heroes Journey as well, but they're over the Kickstarter deadline by almost a year. At this point it's almost vaporware, but I still have my fingers crossed.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm a little nervous myself but I'm keeping the hope alive. They may be late but I'm sure it'll be worth the wait, something to hold my group over until Scion 2nd edition is ready.We'll probably play both, I love anything mythology based.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2276-wasitora","name":"Wasitora","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-05T16:40:28-07:00","id":580336,"title":"","content":"What are you talking about guys? Just check on the HJ blog, they're doing regular updates, it's not vaporwear at all!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-13T02:17:23-07:00","id":588967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/514747-the-missing-john-s-scion-resources-pantheons?p=580336#post580336\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What are you talking about guys? Just check on the HJ blog, they're doing regular updates, it's not vaporwear at all!</div> </div> </div> </div>I think they just announced they are going to be doing